  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A clerk walks Fang Yuan through old man stones, pushing cart stones, stellar stones, and cold ice stones, then urges him to hire the shop’s dissecting masters after buying, because a wrong method can kill a weak Gu inside. He names Master Duan when pitching those masters, and says high and super grade rocks can be dissected free while low and medium cost extra.",
      "chapters": [
        276
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan pays with a purple thorn token, the shopkeeper sends a clerk to call Great Master Duan with Master Huang, Master Zhang, Master Zhao, and Master Ma. The five old masters usually leave ordinary rocks to disciples; Great Master Duan snorts coldly at being asked to dissect low grade rocks, then hurries out once he hears about the purple thorn token.",
      "chapters": [
        277
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "acid-rock-dissection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Most of the five are rank two peak stage; great master Duan is the only rank three. Narration calls him a great expert in dissecting rocks at the den and says he specializes in acid. He fills a large bowl with acid from a snake Gu, shrinks a gambling rock in that bath, then moves it into another acid. The low grade rocks turn out to be solid rock or hollow inside, without even a dead Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        277
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "acid-rock-dissection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
